- added Valkey 8.1 next to Valkey 9
- bumped RabbitMQ to 4.3; management UI back on its default port 15672 (was 8082)
- disabled Redis (commented out); Valkey replaces it
- set the compose project name explicitly (name: servers)
- rebuilt the PHP 8.3/8.4/8.5 and nginx 1.30 images from current base images
- PHP 8.2 stays removed
